    "standard-dialogue": [
      {
        "npc": "Hello mortal. What do you seek?"
      },
      {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "What changes have been made for this League?",
            "steps": [
              {
                "player": "What changes have been made for this League?"
              },
              {
                "npc": "Much has happened since the last passage of the Trailblazers. This time, I have awakened the wrathful spirits of enemies across Gielinor."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Each region now contains a Raging Echo boss. These bosses are more powerful versions of their original self that drop unique rewards."
              },
              {
                "npc": "To help you overcome these new challenges, you may now gain power through Combat Masteries, which you can obtain access to by completing the Combat Mastery tasks."
              },
              {
                "npc": "As before, you'll initially be restricted to the Regions of Misthalin and Karamja. However, as you progress, you'll be able to unlock new areas of your choosing."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Be warned though - you won't be able to unlock every area, so choose wisely."
              },
              {
                "npc": "You must participate as an Ironman. This means you stand alone and cannot trade with other participants."
              },
              {
                "npc": "And that's not all. Training skills during the League will grant you substantially more experience than you'd normally expect."
              },
              {
                "npc": "These experience increases are known as passive effects, which get more generous the higher your Relic tier."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Finally, some quests have been completed for you automatically. Further quests and more will be completed as you unlock the relevant areas."
              },
              {
                "npc": "I think that covers the basics. Would you like to know more, [player name]?"
              },
              {
                "type": "choice",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "text": "Yes, please.",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "player": "Yes, please."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "action",
                        "action": "open_interface",
                        "target": "League Info",
                        "id": "pqpfOG"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Not right now.",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "player": "Not right now."
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "Is there anything else you need from me?"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "initial",
                        "id": "dAjxeO"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Can you tell me about Combat Masteries?",
            "steps": [
              {
                "player": "Can you tell me about Combat Masteries?"
              },
              {
                "npc": "Combat Masteries are powerful boons granted by me that enhance your combat abilities for the entire League."
              },
              {
                "npc": "After all, it wouldn't be very interesting to ask you to defeat the enemies' raging echoes without allowing you to draw on your own."
              },
              {
                "npc": "You can obtain them by completing specific combat tasks to prove yourself to me."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Combat Masteries are split into the three combat styles: Ranged, Melee, and Mage. To unlock each mastery, you must have unlocked the previous mastery for that style."
              },
              {
                "npc": "There are 6 combat masteries for each style, but only 10 mastery points can be obtained. Once you have selected a mastery there is no going back, so choose your masteries wisely."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Now, would you like to take a look at the Combat Masteries available to you?"
              },
              {
                "type": "choice",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "text": "Yes, please.",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "player": "Yes, please."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "action",
                        "action": "open_interface",
                        "target": "Combat Masteries",
                        "id": "pGfL6w"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Not right now.",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "player": "Not right now."
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "Fair enough. Is there anything else you need from me?"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "jump",
                        "reference": "initial",
                        "id": "kksfz5"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "How do tasks work?",
            "steps": [
              {
                "player": "How do tasks work?"
              },
              {
                "npc": "In every League, there are a number of tasks for you to complete. Each task has a level of difficulty: Easy, Medium, Hard, Elite and Master."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Completing tasks allows you to access new areas. The more tasks you complete, the more areas become available to unlock."
              },
              {
                "npc": "Not only that, completing tasks also earns you League Points. The number of points earned is dependent on the difficulty of the task."
              },
              {
                "player": "What do these points do?"
              },
              {
                "npc": "Once you have achieved a certain amount of League Points you can unlock a new Relic of mine. These are powerful artefacts to help you in this world."
              },
              {
                "npc": "League Points can also be used to buy rewards from the Leagues Reward Shop."
              },
              {
                "type": "message",
                "text": "As we speak, you are playing on your Leagues profile. The Leagues Reward Shop can only be opened on your main profile.",
                "id": "uL21nS"
              },
              {
                "type": "message",
                "text": "You can access your main profile by switching to any normal Old School RuneScape world. The world switcher in the logout menu can be used to switch worlds.",
                "id": "uVuCuQ"
              },
              {
                "player": "So how many tasks are there?"
              },
              {
                "npc": "More than you'll ever be able to complete, most likely. It's up to you which ones you attempt."
              },
              {
                "player": "Thanks!"
              },
              {
                "npc": "Now, would you like to take a look at the tasks for this League?"
              },
              {
                "type": "choice",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "text": "Yes, please.",
