          {
            "text": "How does the area system work?",
            "steps": [
              {
                "player": "How does the area system work?"
              },
              {
                "npc": "Currently, you are restricted to the Kingdom of Misthalin and the island of Karamja. However, as you progress, you can unlock more areas."
              },
              {
                "npc": "There are eleven different areas in total. However, you can only unlock a maximum of five, including the two you've started with. Choose wisely."
              },
              {
                "npc": "I give the first two area unlocks to everyone. You can unlock the other three by completing the tasks I've set."
              },
              {
                "npc": "The more tasks you complete, the more areas you can unlock."
              },
              {
                "player": "I see. Thanks!"
