                        "type": "choice",
                        "options": [
                          {
                            "text": "Tell me about League rewards.",
                            "steps": [
                              {
                                "player": "Tell me about League rewards."
                              },
                              {
                                "npc": "As well as letting you unlock new areas, completing tasks in the League will earn you League Points. The more League Points you have, the more Relic tiers you have available."
                              },
                              {
                                "npc": "However, alongside allowing you to unlock Relics, League Points can also be used to buy rewards from the Leagues Reward Shop."
                              },
                              {
                                "player": "What rewards can I buy?"
                              },
                              {
                                "npc": "Oh, all sorts of things. New cosmetic kits, an alternative Home Teleport animation, some rather stylish outfits... and much more."
                              },
                              {
                                "npc": "Many of these rewards can be traded with your fellow mortals, so if you wish, you can earn some money by selling them on. Of course, you might prefer to keep them for yourself instead."
